## Wallets & Self-Custody
*Holding your own keys.*

- [Bitcoin Wallet](https://www.bitcoin.com/wallet/bitcoin/): Bitcoin.com's non-custodial BTC wallet — explains custody models, public and private keys, hot vs. cold storage, and how to store, send, receive, and manage BTC while retaining sole control of your private keys.
- [Bitcoin.com Wallet](https://www.bitcoin.com/wallet/): Bitcoin.com's non-custodial multi-chain wallet app, supporting BTC, BCH, ETH, AVAX, MATIC, and BNB.
- [How to Send Bitcoin](https://www.bitcoin.com/wallet/how-to-send-bitcoin/): Constructing a transaction, choosing a fee, and confirming delivery.
- [How to Receive Bitcoin](https://www.bitcoin.com/wallet/how-to-receive-bitcoin/): Generating an address and verifying an incoming payment.
